{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXILED AND ABANDONED</strong>  <br>Banished from your homeland, you awaken the dormant powers of necromancy within you. On a secluded forest clearing, you raise your shrine and repel wave after wave of heroic attackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT</strong> <br>Take the fight to your foes by engaging them head-on, or let your towers and skeletal legion do the heavy lifting. The battlefield is yours to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587220/extras/fight.gif?t=1743418511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong> <br>Construct towers, fences, barracks, and a vast array of structures. Every placement is in your hands\u2014strategize and design the ultimate defense.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587220/extras/build_gif.gif?t=1743418511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GATHER RESOURCES</strong>  <br>Gather vital resources and grow your base. With each expansion, you strengthen your hold against increasingly formidable enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587220/extras/gather_resources.gif?t=1743418511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>IMPROVE</strong> <br>Earn experience with every encounter, unlock powerful perks, and refine your strategy to make each run better than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587220/extras/skelton_army.gif?t=1743418511\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ABOUT THE DEMO</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and defend your base on the &quot;Fall&quot; map </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three more maps with different  map layouts in the full version</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock 4 blessings and 3 curses </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">15 blessings and 10 curses in the full version</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Solve 3 quests </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">13 quests in the full version</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is limited to 30 nights </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlimited in full version</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The max player level you can reach in the demo is 10 \u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">25 in the full version</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The full version will have almost 100 steam achievements</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587220?t=1743418511","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3587220?t=1743418511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587220/b86cf5bdcd9dded0056ec6c6478365257faf5512/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743418511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587220/b86cf5bdcd9dded0056ec6c6478365257faf5512/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743418511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>EXILED AND ABANDONED</strong>  <br>Banished from your homeland, you awaken the dormant powers of necromancy within you. On a secluded forest clearing, you raise your shrine and repel wave after wave of heroic attackers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FIGHT</strong